<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-NationsBank said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-NationsBank said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NationsBank Corp was raised to a buy from a hold by Prudential, according to a source at the brokerage, and the the stock was given a 12 month price target of $115.</p>
<p>-- NationsBank shares were given a 12-month price target of $115, according to the source.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 94-1/8 on the New York Stock Exchange on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- No further details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
